<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen Stock Exchange to close for two weeks.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen Stock Exchange to close for two weeks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shenzhen Stock Exchange will close for two weeks starting on Monday for the Chinese lunar new year holiday, an exchange statement said on Friday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on February 17, Monday, it said.</p>
<p>On Friday, Shenzhen's B share index closed up 1.68 percent at 157.06 points. The A share index ended up 0.05 percent at 372.54 points.</p>
